      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18791692bfe3afb4eed54e9b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身为一族的成员，顺利贯彻了应尽的责任。\\n我感到非常喜悦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "245c11695a79e60c2787bc367a6fbbfbdb66b31248473f41c424ab037a913741",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "986"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c523103b5470cd45b5eedb97",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "方才，我已透过电话收到来自双亲的赞赏。\\n──下场比赛也定要拿出与评价相符的贡献。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0243e23889cba9a4750f5f23f17d2148784ec57a65a27aa40281a0e9af473cb8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "987"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a859f72778818652954bccd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身为一族的成员，顺利贯彻了应尽的责任。\\n我感到非常喜悦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "245c11695a79e60c2787bc367a6fbbfbdb66b31248473f41c424ab037a913741",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "988"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3cb35b9bb2a66babface196",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "方才，我已透过电话收到来自双亲的赞赏。\\n──下场比赛也定要拿出与评价相符的贡献。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0243e23889cba9a4750f5f23f17d2148784ec57a65a27aa40281a0e9af473cb8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "989"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ac1990f6c249de4b17b56dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这种要求跳过。\\n我没办法说出那种得体的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4de1da9a15bb34386e7848ef7b3ead86aeb80afd964065d5ad80c813e1eaad0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "99"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:378e00701ba506e8fdb70882",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "效法鲁道夫──吃了炸猪排店的炸肉串──\\n象征精彩的──表现和胜利──word play.",
      "source_fingerprint": "120b7393373078242adcb50d9257836a35c55f5a62f4556e90077ac4b16c83cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "990"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81a9969492ace024668946a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有──因为任务尚未完成──\\n「优胜」──直到达成这个目标为止──",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbdf135ab3abb19a41e0d945bcece514e8692e3d358f64cfab81a3d9742ab93b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "991"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:321d3fe14c8ffd24724b09e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的恩人──也来为我加油了──\\n──能让他看见我的胜利，我很欣慰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a10003b367d58ca362b99f779a66e955a8e1d3a465a7ef8b300654e14d1901",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "992"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:654357e1d7b70b07fe538172",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我爱喝的水──大家都称赞──说很好喝──\\n现在在training后──我们会一起喝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "079eccaa46ba8c9b239b38dc344572040a6e52b28f48d3c727e800d195688c73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "993"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32b4269f493f1e275e68b501",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢──在coffee break后，\\n希望各位──能拭目以待──我决赛的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba37445b75944fd81f198e2915696e4af148aa142b672f720dc69c1eaad450b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "994"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:058dc83502f6bfae9d4c41a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的恩人──也来为我加油了──\\n──能让他看见我的胜利，我很欣慰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a10003b367d58ca362b99f779a66e955a8e1d3a465a7ef8b300654e14d1901",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
